view with her hair flowing naturally\u2014each view emphasizing her ethereal presence and magical aura. The art style is vibrant, no lineart, flat color, inspired by Studio Ghibli and celestial fantasy, with bold, clean color blocks and a magical, detailed atmosphere, G0thicL1nes."], "color": "#232", "bgcolor": "#353"}, {"id": 46, "type": "LoraLoader", "pos": [66.22698974609375, 585.2600708007812], "size": [270, 126], "flags": {}, "order": 5, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "model", "type": "MODEL", "link": 68}, {"name": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "link": 70}], "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "links": [73]}, {"name": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "links": [71, 72]}], "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.41", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoader"}, "widgets_values": ["Lora\\FluxMythG0thicL1nes.safetensors", 1, 1]}, {"id": 31, "type": "KSampler", "pos": [816, 192], "size": [315, 474], "flags": {}, "order": 9, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "model", "type": "MODEL", "link": 73}, {"name": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "link": 57}, {"name": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "link": 55}, {"name": "latent_image", "type": "LATENT", "link": 51}], "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [52]}], "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.41", "Node name for S&R": "KSampler", "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "widgets_values": [544138144389245, "randomize", 20, 1, "euler", "simple", 1]}], "links": [[9, 8, 0, 9, 0, "IMAGE"], [51, 27, 0, 31, 3, "LATENT"], [52, 31, 0, 8, 0, "LATENT"], [55, 33, 0, 31, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [56, 6, 0, 35, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [57, 35, 0, 31, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [66, 44, 2, 8, 1, "VAE"], [67, 44, 0, 45, 0, "MODEL"], [68, 45, 0, 46, 0, "MODEL"], [69, 44, 1, 45, 1, "CLIP"], [70, 45, 1, 46, 1, "CLIP"], [71, 46, 1, 6, 0, "CLIP"], [72, 46, 1, 33, 0, "CLIP"], [73, 46, 0, 31, 0, "MODEL"]], "groups": [], "config": {}, "extra": {"ds": {"scale": 0.7272727272727281, "offset"